hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"874","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke paas thay aur unhon ne Hafsa ke ghar mein ijazat maangnay walay aik mard ki awaz suni. Aisha ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Ye aik mard hai jo Aap ke ghar mein dakhil honay ki ijazat maang raha hai. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mera khayal hai ke wo falan hai, Hafsa ka doodh shareek chacha. To Aisha ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Agar doodh shareek chacha falan zinda hota to kya wo mere paas dakhil ho sakta? To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Haan, beshak doodh shareeki un cheezon ko haraam karti hai jinhein wiladat (nasabi rishta) haraam karti hai. (Muslim: 4/162). Baab: Mard ke (doodh ki wajah se) doodh shareeki ka haraam hona."
"875","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mera doodh shareek chacha mere paas dakhil honay ki ijazat maangnay aaya to main ne usay ijazat denay se inkar kiya yahan tak ke main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ijazat talab karun. Phir jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef laye to main ne kaha: Beshak mere doodh shareek chacha ne mere paas dakhil honay ki ijazat maangi to main ne usay ijazat denay se inkar kiya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tumhara chacha tumharay paas dakhil ho sakta hai. Main ne kaha: Mujhe to aurat ne doodh pilaya hai, mard ne mujhe doodh nahi pilaya. Farmaya: Beshak wo tumhara chacha hai, wo tumharay paas dakhil ho sakta hai. (Muslim: 4/163). Baab: Doodh shareek bhatiji ka haraam hona."
"876","[AI-translation] Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ko kya hai ke Aap Quraish mein (nikah ke liye) khoob chunn kar intekhab kartay hain aur hamein chhor detay hain? To Aap ne farmaya: Tumharay paas koi (rishta) hai? Main ne kaha: Haan, Hamza ki beti. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak wo mere liye halal nahi, beshak wo doodh shareeki mein mere bhai ki beti hai. (Muslim: 4/164). (Tanawwuq se murad baareek beeni se intekhab karna hai.)"
"877","[AI-translation] Umm Habiba bint Abu Sufyan (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas tashreef laye to main ne Aap se kaha: Kya Aap meri behan bint Abu Sufyan mein raghbat rakhtay hain? To Aap ne farmaya: Main kya karun? Main ne kaha: Aap us se nikah kar lein. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum isay pasand karti ho? Main ne kaha: Main Aap ke sath tanhai mein mufrad nahi hun, aur khair mein mera shareek honay wali mujhe sab se zyada pasand meri behan hai. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo mere liye halal nahi. Main ne kaha: Mujhe khabar di gayi hai ke Aap Durra bint Abu Salama ko paigham de rahay hain. Aap ne farmaya: Umm Salama ki beti? Main ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Agar wo meri god mein parwarish paanay wali (rabiba) na bhi hoti tab bhi wo mere liye halal na hoti, beshak wo doodh shareeki mein mere bhai ki beti hai, mujhe aur us ke baap ko Suwaiba ne doodh pilaya tha. To apni betiyan aur apni behnein mere saamnay paish na karo. (Muslim: 4/165). Baab: Aik ya do ghoont (doodh peenay) ke baaray mein."
"878","[AI-translation] Umm Fadl (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik dehati Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya jabke Aap mere ghar mein thay, to us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Nabi! Meri aik biwi thi, phir main ne us par doosri se shaadi ki, to meri pehli biwi ka daawa hai ke us ne meri nai biwi ko aik ya do ghoont doodh pilaya hai. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aik ya do baar choosna (doodh peena) haraam nahi karta. (Muslim: 4/167). Baab: Paanch ghoont (doodh) ke baaray mein."
"879","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Quran mein se jo naazil hua tha us mein das maloom ghoont thay jo haraam kartay thay, phir wo paanch maloom ghoont se mansookh ho gaye, phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) wafaat paa gaye jabke wo Quran mein se padhi janay wali (ayaat) mein thin. (Muslim: 4/167). Baab: Baray (umar ke bachay) ko doodh pilanay ke baaray mein. (Muslim mein ""wohunna"" hai, yani paanch ghoont; murad ye hai ke un ka nasakh bohat aakhir mein naazil hua.)"
"880","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Salim, Abu Huzaifa ka azaad kardah ghulam, Abu Huzaifa aur us ke ghar walon ke saath un ke ghar mein tha, to Suhail ki beti, yani Abu Huzaifa ki biwi, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi aur kaha: Beshak Salim us umar ko pahunch gaya hai jisay mard pahunchay hain aur wo wohi samajhta hai jo wo samajhtay hain, aur wo hamaray paas (ghar mein) aata hai, aur mera khayal hai ke Abu Huzaifa ke dil mein is baat se naagawari hai. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Usay doodh pila do to tum par wo haraam (mahram) ho jaye ga, aur jo naagawari Abu Huzaifa ke dil mein hai wo door ho jaye gi. Phir wo dobara aayi aur kaha: Main ne usay doodh pila diya hai aur jo naagawari Abu Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) ke dil mein thi wo door ho gayi hai. (Muslim: 4/168-169)"
"881","[AI-translation] Zainab bint Umm Salama se, un ki walida Umm Salama, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja, se riwayat hai ke wo kehti thin ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki baaqi tamaam azwaaj ne inkar kiya ke un ke paas us (qisam ki) doodh shareeki (walay) ke sath koi dakhil ho, aur unhon ne Aisha se kaha: Allah ki qasam! Ham isay sirf aik rukhsat samajhti hain jo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khaas Salim ke liye di thi, to is doodh shareeki ke sath hamaray paas koi dakhil na hoga aur na ham isay (jaaiz) samajhti hain. (Muslim: 4/169-170). Baab: Doodh shareeki sirf bhook (choti umar) mein hoti hai."
"882","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas tashreef laye jabke mere paas aik mard baitha hua tha, to Aap par ye (baat) sakht guzri aur main ne Aap ke chehray mein ghussa dekha. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak wo mera doodh shareek bhai hai. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne farmaya: Apne doodh shareek bhaiyon ko dekha karo (ke wo waqai doodh shareek hain ya nahi), beshak doodh shareeki sirf bhook (yani choti umar) mein hoti hai. (Muslim: 4/170)"
